 style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=96 valign=top style='width:72.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:9.9pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:9.9pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=162 valign=top style='width:121.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:9.9pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:26.1pt'>\r\n  <td width=372 valign=top style='width:279.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:26.1pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>THYROXINE\r\n  FREE (FT4),Serum <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ECLIA<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=96 valign=top style='width:72.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:26.1pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span\r\n  lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>0.78<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:26.1pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ng\/dL<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=162 valign=top style='width:121.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:26.1pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>0.80-2.70<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.15pt'>\r\n  <td width=372 valign=top style='width:279.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.15pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=96 valign=top style='width:72.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.15pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.15pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=162 valign=top style='width:121.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.15pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:21.15pt'>\r\n  <td width=372 valign=top style='width:279.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:21.15pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>THYROID\r\n  STIMULATING HORMONE (TSH),Serum<\/span><\/b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ECLIA<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=96 valign=top style='width:72.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:21.15pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>1.36<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:21.15pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00b5IU\/ml<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=162 valign=top style='width:121.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:21.15pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>0.35-5.50<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:5.0pt'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>NOTE-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>TSH\r\nlevels are subject to circadian variation, reaching peak levels between 2-4 AM\r\nand min between 6-10 PM. The variation is the order of 50% hence time of the\r\nday has influence on the measures serum TSH concentration. Dose and time of\r\ndrug intake also influence the test result. Transient increase in TSH levels or\r\nabnormal TSH levels can be seen in some non thyroidal conditions, simultaneous\r\nmeasurement of TSH with free T4 is useful in evaluating differential diagnosis.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>INTERPRETATION-<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> Ultra\r\nSensitive 4th generation assay<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a01.\r\nPrimary hyperthyroidism is accompanied by \u2191serum T3 &amp; T4 values along with\r\n\u2193 TSH level. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a02.\r\nLow TSH, high FT4 and TSH receptor antibody (TRAb) +ve seen in patients with\r\nGraves disease <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a03.\r\nLow TSH, high FT4 and TSH receptor antibody (TRAb) -ve seen in patients with\r\nToxic adenoma\/Toxic Multinodular goiter 4.HighTSH,Low\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nFT4 and Thyroid microsomal antibody increased seen in patients with Hashimotos\r\nthyroiditis <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a05.\r\nHighTSH,Low FT4 and Thyroid microsomal antibody normal seen in patients with\r\nIodine deficiency\/Congenital T4 synthesis deficiency <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a06.\r\nLow TSH, Low FT4 and TRH stimulation test -Delayed response seen in patients\r\nwith Tertiary hypothyroidism <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a07.\r\nPrimary hypothyroidism is accompanied by \u2193 serum T3 and T4 values &amp; \u2191serum\r\nTSH levels <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a08.\r\nNormal T4 levels accompanied by \u2191 T3 levels and low TSH are seen in patients\r\nwith T3 Thyrotoxicosis <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a09.\r\nNormal or\u2193 T3 &amp; \u2191T4 levels indicate T4 Thyrotoxicosis (problem is\r\nconversion of T4 to T3) <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>10.\r\nNormal T3 &amp; T4 along with \u2193 TSH indicate mild \/ Subclinical Hyperthyroidism\r\n. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>11.\r\nNormal T3 &amp; \u2193 T4 along with \u2191 TSH is seen in Hypothyroidism . <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>12.\r\nNormal T3 &amp; T4 levels with \u2191 TSH indicate Mild \/ Subclinical Hypothyroidism\r\n. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>13.\r\nSlightly \u2191 T3 levels may be found in pregnancy and in estrogen therapy while \u2193\r\nlevels may be encountered in severe illness , <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nmalnutrition, renal failure and during therapy with drugs like propanolol. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>14.\r\nAlthough \u2191 TSH levels are nearly always indicative of Primary Hypothroidism,\r\nrarely they can result from TSH secreting pituitary\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\ntumours.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DURING\r\nPREGNANCY - REFERENCE RANGE for TSH IN uIU\/mL (As per American Thyroid\r\nAssociation)<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>1st\r\nTrimester: 0.10-2.50 uIU\/mL <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>2nd\r\nTrimester : 0.20-3.00 uIU\/mL <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>3rd\r\nTrimester : 0.30-3.00 uIU\/Ml<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>The\r\nproduction, circulation, and disintegration of thyroid hormones are altered\r\nthroughout the stages of pregnancy.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt'>REMARK-Assay\r\nresults should be interpreted in context to the clinical condition and associated\r\nresults of other investigations. Previous treatment with corticosteroid therapy\r\nmay result in lower TSH levels while thyroid hormone levels are normal. Results\r\nare invalidated if the client has undergone a radionuclide scan within 7-14\r\ndays before the test. Abnormal thyroid test findings often found in critically\r\nill patients should be repeated after the critical nature of the condition is\r\nresolved.TSH is an important marker for the diagnosis of thyroid dysfunction.\r\nRecent studies have shown that the TSH distribution progressively shifts to a\r\nhigher concentration with age ,and it is debatable whether this is due to a\r\nreal change with age or an increasing proportion of unrecognized thyroid\r\ndisease in the elderly.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US>.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251657216;left:-52px;\r\ntop:252px;width:994px;height:254px'><img width=795 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlh4gMCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAADiAwIAgAAAAAAAAAJGBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLNf0bef4rvf87wsChwaiUYg8KpPMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9ytNwEoAAA7\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT\r\nOF PATHOLOGY<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>SPECIMEN<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 :<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\nSERUM.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<table class=MsoNormalTable border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0 width=722\r\n style='width:541.3pt;border-collapse:collapse'>\r\n <tr style='height:14.35pt'>\r\n  <td width=296 valign=top style='width:222.15pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.35pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>INVESTIGATION<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=121 valign=top style='width:90.55pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.35pt'>\r\n  <h3><span lang=EN-US>RESULTS<\/span><\/h3>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=73 valign=top style='width:54.95pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.35pt'>\r\n  <h4><span lang=EN-US>UNIT<\/span><\/h4>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=232 valign=top style='width:173.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.35pt'>\r\n  <h4><span lang=EN-US>REFERENCE RANGE<\/span><\/h4>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <td width=296 valign=top style='width:222.15pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=121 valign=top style='width:90.55pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=73 valign=top style='width:54.95pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=232 valign=top style='width:173.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:10.4pt'>\r\n  <td width=296 valign=top style='width:222.15pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:10.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=121 valign=top style='width:90.55pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:10.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=73 valign=top style='width:54.95pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:10.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=232 valign=top style='width:173.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:10.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <td width=296 valign=top style='width:222.15pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>FREE TRI-IODOTHYRONINE(F-T3)<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=121 valign=top style='width:90.55pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=73 valign=top style='width:54.95pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>pg\/ml<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=232 valign=top style='width:173.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Adult=1.4\r\n  - 4.2 pg\/ml<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:26.4pt'>\r\n  <td width=296 valign=top style='width:222.15pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:26.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt'>(enzyme \u2013linked\r\n  immunosorbent assay )<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=121 valign=top style='width:90.55pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:26.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=73 valign=top style='width:54.95pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:26.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=232 valign=top style='width:173.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:26.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Pregnancy\r\n  =1.8 \u2013 4.2 pg\/ml<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <td width=296 valign=top style='width:222.15pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=121 valign=top style='width:90.55pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=73 valign=top style='width:54.95pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=232 valign=top style='width:173.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:13.6pt'>\r\n  <td width=296 valign=top style='width:222.15pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.6pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>FREE THYROXINE (FT4)<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=121 valign=top style='width:90.55pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.6pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=73 valign=top style='width:54.95pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.6pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ng\/dL<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=232 valign=top style='width:173.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:13.6pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>0.8\r\n  - 2.0 ng\/dl\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <td width=296 valign=top style='width:222.15pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt'>(enzyme \u2013linked\r\n  immunosorbent assay )<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=121 valign=top style='width:90.55pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=73 valign=top style='width:54.95pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=232 valign=top style='width:173.65pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.85pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>F-T3:-<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Triiodothyronine,\r\na thyroid hormone, circulates in blood bound to carrier proteins (1,2). The\r\nmain transport protein is thyroxine binding globulin (TBG). However, only the\r\nfree (unbound) portion of Triiodothyronine is believed to be responsible for\r\nthe biological action. Further, the concentrations of carrier proteins are\r\naltered in many clinical conditions, such as pregnancy. In normal thyroid\r\nfunction as the concentrations of the carrier proteins altars, the total\r\nTriiodothyronine level changes so that the free Triiodothyronine concentration\r\nremains constant. Thus, measurements of free Triiodothyronine concentrations\r\ncorrelate more reliably with clinical status than total Triiodothyronine\r\nlevels.\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><u><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><u><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>F-T4:-<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\r\nThyroxin, the principal thyroid hormone, circulates in blood almost completely\r\nbound to carrier proteins. The main carrier is thyroxine-binding globulin\r\n(TBG). However, only the free (unbound) portion of thyroxine is responsible for\r\nthe biological action. Further, the concentrations of the carrier proteins are\r\naltered in many clinical condition\u2019s, such as pregnancy. In normal thyroid\r\nfunction as the concentrations of the carrier proteins alters, the total\r\nthyroxin level changes so that the free thyroxine concentration remains\r\nconstant. Thus, measurements of free thyroxine concentrations correlate better\r\nwith clinical status than total thyroxine levels. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>\u00a0The increase in\r\ntotal thyroxine associated with pregnancy, oral contraceptives and estrogen\r\ntherapy occasionally result in total T4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 levels over the limits of normal\r\nwhile the free thyroxine concentration remains in the normal reference range.\r\nMasking of abnormal thyroid function can also occur in both hyper and\r\nhypothyroid conditions by alterations in the TBG concentration. The total T4\r\ncan be elevated or lowered by TBG changes such that the normal reference levels\r\nresult. The free thyroxine concentration can help in uncovering the patient\u2019s\r\nactual clinical status.\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Clinical\r\ncorrelation is suggested. <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Lisa\r\nScan-EM (Semi-Automated Clinical ELISA Analyzer)<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>OUT SIDE SAMPLE<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"595.45pt 841.7pt","margin":"151.2pt 36.0pt 72.0pt 36.0pt"}}